ord on Gujarat RERA portal", "para": "The Gujarat Real Estate Regulatory Authority has launched an innovative section on its website specifically designed for homebuyers. This new feature showcases the past performances of project promoters in Gujarat, allowing users to easily access crucial information such as project documents, timelines for completion, and any complaints associated with previous projects.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/rera/now-promoters-track-record-on-gujarat-rera-portal/136178208?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-92722/136178208.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "rera"}]}